# Direct dependency policy for the private Harness v2 worker.
#
# `requirements.txt` is generated from this file with uv 0.11.15 for the
# digest-pinned Linux/amd64 + Python 3.12 runtime. The CUDA 12.6 Torch wheel is
# addressed directly by immutable URL and SHA-256 so resolution cannot drift to
# PyPI CUDA 13 or to a different package index. The flattened lock owns the
# entire Python/CUDA wheel closure; the Ubuntu image supplies only the operating
# system and host-injected NVIDIA driver interface.

